[en.FOCUS_C18_000_EDUCATION]
Education Reform

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_EDUCATION_desc]
Many Kirins still have little knowledge of the outside world, which is the biggest obstacle to Kirins’ opening up to the world. A few years ago, Twilight Sparkle revitalized Equestria by holding the School of Friendship — her attempt failed, perhaps she just because she didn’t have enough time. Even so, their successor, Cozy Glow, is also developing the empire’s characteristic education.\nUnlike Equestria, we are not currently facing serious threats. The education reform is precisely to arm the Kirins with knowledge to prevent future crises. The most important part of our education is in the east and the forest.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_EDUCATION]
教育改革

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_EDUCATION_desc]
许多麒麟依然对外界没有什么认知，这是阻碍麒麟与世界接轨的最大障碍。数年前，暮光闪闪就依靠着举办友谊学校振兴了小马利亚——虽然她的尝试失败了，但也许只是没有获得足够的时间。而即使是这样，她们的继任者和煦光流，也在发展帝国特色的教育。\n不同于小马利亚，我们暂时并未面临着严重的威胁，现在进行教育改革，恰恰是为了让麒麟们用知识武装自己以防范未来的危机。而教育的重中之重，在东方与森林中。

